2
Display the employees who earn more than the average salary of EMP
table. (Nested Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, SAL
     FROM EMP
     WHERE SAL >
     (
         SELECT AVG(SAL)
         FROM EMP
     );

